  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Sisters of St Louis PROJECT: This project in Domeabra, Ghana aims to improve health outcomes in this rural community by rehabilitation of St John&#x2019;s Health Centre and development of its community health outreach so as to enhance access to quality health care and nutrition for especially women and those under 5 years of age.  Significant remedial work will be doon the hospital including re-roofing, with new maternity, OPD, emergency unit, lab, consulting and counselling rooms, dispensary, storage, records office and staff offices.</narrative>
  </description>
